  triage:notes "Contradictory assertions: lines 223-234 expect warnings[0].message to contain 'ATM deferred remote ack delivery', but build_remote_deferred_outcome sets warnings: Vec::new(). Lines 252-253 assert pending_ack_at.is_none() and acknowledged_at.is_some(), requiring acknowledged local state for a deferred remote ack outcome. Test name says 'stays_pending' but assertions require it to be acknowledged." .

